@startuml componentes-smartmed-en

left to right direction
'skinparam linetype ortho

' =========================
' Componentes
' =========================
component "Notification"                                   as C_Notification
component "Adherence &\nMonitoring"                       as C_AdherenceMonitoring
component "Medication &\nPrescription"                    as C_MedicationPrescription
component "Inventory &\n Storage"                          as C_InventoryStorage
component "Administration &\nConfiguration"               as C_AdminConfiguration
component "Sensors &\nCalibration"                        as C_SensorsCalibration
component "Security,\nIdentity &\nCompliance"            as C_SecurityIdentityCompliance
component "Integration &\nInteroperability"               as C_IntegrationInteroperability
component "Reliability &\n Observability"                  as C_ReliabilityObservability

' =========================
' Relationships (preserving semantics; condensed)
' =========================

' 1) Main functional flows (collaboration → solid line)
C_SensorsCalibration        --> C_AdherenceMonitoring           : raw\ntelemetry
C_AdherenceMonitoring       --> C_MedicationPrescription        : rules/dosage
C_Notification              --> C_AdherenceMonitoring           : irregularities
C_Notification              --> C_InventoryStorage              : low\nstock

' 2) Administration/Configuration (business → solid line)
C_AdminConfiguration        --> C_AdherenceMonitoring           : thresholds
C_AdminConfiguration        --> C_InventoryStorage              : minimum\nlevels
C_AdminConfiguration        --> C_SensorsCalibration            : calibration

' 3) External integrations (dependency → dashed arrow)
C_MedicationPrescription    ..> C_IntegrationInteroperability   : Electronic Medical Record /\nElectronic Health Record
C_InventoryStorage          ..> C_IntegrationInteroperability   : Enterprise Resource\nPlanning
C_AdminConfiguration        ..> C_IntegrationInteroperability   : endpoints/keys

' 4) Cross-cutting: Security/Identity/LGPD (dependency → dashed arrow)
C_MedicationPrescription    ..> C_SecurityIdentityCompliance    : General Data\nProtection Law
C_SensorsCalibration        ..> C_SecurityIdentityCompliance    : device\nidentity
C_IntegrationInteroperability ..> C_SecurityIdentityCompliance  : contracts/Data\nProcessing Agreements
C_AdminConfiguration        ..> C_SecurityIdentityCompliance    : audit

' 5) Operations/Observability (dependency → dashed arrow)
C_AdherenceMonitoring       ..> C_ReliabilityObservability      : metrics/logs
C_Notification              ..> C_ReliabilityObservability      : delivery/latency
C_IntegrationInteroperability ..> C_ReliabilityObservability    : integrations

@enduml
